PsychoticMuffin wrote:
> What's the deal with them? How does your character make one? None of my 
> characters have been making them when they die. But I haven't gotten far 
> at ALL in the game, the farthest I have gotten has pretty much been lvl 5.

If you die bones may be created with a 25% probability, but not in the
first few (four, or so) levels. Whenever you enter a new level where
there is some bones file existing this bones file may be loaded again
with a 25% probability. If you reguarily don't get deeper than dungeon
level 5 you won't see many bones level on average.

On bones levels you will find the former adventurer in some non-living
form (ghost, zombie, ...) and all his loot, though most of it is cursed.
There will also be the critter(s) around that killed the former player;
thus be careful when you encounter a bones level.

